  m_text: 'Customers line up at the delivery window, each holding a speech bubble
    with the toy they want.\n\nBuild the toy, paint it, and hand it over before their
    patience bar runs out.\n\nServe them in any order: the right toy always goes
    to whoever asked for it first.'
