  m_text: <b>Move:</b> WASD / Arrow keys, or the joystick on touch screens\n\n<b>Interact
    (E):</b> pick up, place, take, deliver\n\n<b>Melt (F):</b> hammer the melter\n\n<b>Pause
    (ESC):</b> settings, restart, main menu\n\nA prompt above each machine tells
